---
import "../../styles/global.css";
import Nav from "../../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Privacy Policy - See My Eyes | Blind Pixels Studio</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for See My Eyes iOS app by Blind Pixels Studio." />
	</head>
	<body class="page">
		<Nav />
		<div class="layout">
			<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
				<header class="page-header">
					<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">See My Eyes</p>
				</header>

				<section class="content-section">
					<p class="last-updated">Last updated: November 17, {currentYear}</p>

					<h2>Overview</h2>
					<p>
						See My Eyes is designed with your privacy in mind. It is an educational app that uses your
						device's camera to simulate how different vision conditions — such as tunnel vision, central blur,
						distortion, contrast loss, and color differences — can change the way the world looks, in real time.
						We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about our practices.
					</p>

					<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
					<h3>Information You Don't Provide</h3>
					<p>
						<strong>See My Eyes does not collect, store, or transmit any personal information.</strong> The app:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Does not require you to create an account</li>
						<li>Does not collect your name, email, or contact information</li>
						<li>Does not track your location</li>
						<li>Does not collect device identifiers or advertising IDs</li>
						<li>Does not send your camera feed, photos, or videos off your device</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>Settings and Preferences</h3>
					<p>
						Any simulation options and custom presets you configure are stored on your device so the app can
						remember your preferences. See My Eyes does not use analytics and does not build a profile of how
						you use the app.
					</p>

					<h2>Camera, Photos, and Media</h2>
					<p>
						See My Eyes uses your device's camera to show simulated vision effects in real time. Camera frames
						are processed entirely on your device and are never saved, uploaded, or shared by the app.
					</p>
					<p>
						See My Eyes Pro adds side-by-side comparison, video recording, photo import and capture, and
						watermark-free exports. This media is processed on your device, and anything you choose to save is
						stored only where you direct it (for example, your device's photo library). We do not receive,
						upload, or have access to your recordings, photos, or exports.
					</p>

					<h2>Purchases</h2>
					<p>
						See My Eyes offers an optional one-time in-app purchase to unlock Pro features. Purchases are
						processed by Apple through the App Store. We do not collect or receive your payment information.
						Apple's handling of purchase data is governed by Apple's own privacy policy.
					</p>

					<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
					<p>
						See My Eyes does not integrate with any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services.
						Aside from Apple processing optional in-app purchases through the App Store, the app runs
						independently on your device.
					</p>

					<h2>Data Security</h2>
					<p>
						Your camera feed and simulations are processed on your device and are not transmitted to us. Any
						media you save stays on your device unless you choose to share it. Your information is protected by
						Apple's built-in security features and your device's passcode or biometric authentication.
					</p>

					<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
					<p>
						See My Eyes does not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children under 13. 
						The app is safe for all ages as it does not collect or transmit any personal data.
					</p>

					<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
					<p>
						If we make changes to this privacy policy, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. 
						We will also notify users through the App Store update notes if there are significant changes to our privacy practices.
					</p>

					<h2>Contact Us</h2>
					<p>
						If you have questions about this privacy policy or See My Eyes, please contact us at:
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@blindpixelsstudio.com">support@blindpixelsstudio.com</a>
					</p>
				</section>
			</main>
		</div>
		<Footer />
	</body>
	<style lang="css">
		.layout {
			width: min(1080px, 100% - 3rem);
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 4rem 0 6.25rem;
		}

		.page-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.page-header h1 {
			font-size: 3rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
			background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f1f5ff, #93c5fd);
			-webkit-background-clip: text;
			-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			background-clip: text;
		}

		.subtitle {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
			color: #93c5fd;
			margin: 0;
		}

		.content-section {
			background: rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.4);
			border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.1);
			border-radius: 1rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.last-updated {
			color: #94a3b8;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			margin-top: 0;
			font-style: italic;
		}

		.content-section h2 {
			color: #f1f5ff;
			font-size: 1.75rem;
			margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
		}

		.content-section h2:first-of-type {
			margin-top: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section h3 {
			color: #93c5fd;
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
		}

		.content-section p {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section ul {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			padding-left: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section li {
			margin: 0.5rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section a {
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: underline;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.content-section a:hover,
		.content-section a:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		.content-section strong {
			color: #f1f5ff;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			.page-header h1 {
				font-size: 2.25rem;
			}

			.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
			}

			.content-section {
				padding: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h2 {
				font-size: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h3 {
				font-size: 1.125rem;
			}
		}
	</style>
</html>
